      <div type="clause" n="8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wif">Wif</ref> 8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Æt þam giftan sceal mæssepreost beon mid rihte, se sceal mid Godes bletsunge heora gesomnunge gederian an ealre gesundfulnesse.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">At the marriage there should by rights be a mass-priest, who shall unite them together with God's blessing in all prosperity.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Æt ðam giftan sceal mæssepreost beon mid rihte, se sceal mid Godes bletsunge heora gesomnunge gederian on ealre gesundfulnesse.</ab>
